{"id":"d3eb2e8e337f64cc","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order.md","title":"Pointed directed complete orders","display":"df-pointed-directed-complete-order — Pointed directed complete orders","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order","aliases":["72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order"],"display":"df-pointed-directed-complete-order — Pointed directed complete orders","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter X, section 3.9, cpo convention and monotone fixed-point theorem, printed pp.748-749 / PDF pp.760-761","source_statement_checked":true,"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked","proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pointed-directed-complete-order — Pointed directed complete orders"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter X, section 3.9, cpo convention and monotone fixed-point theorem, printed pp.748-749 / PDF pp.760-761"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 是集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq\\subseteq D^2\">\\(\\preceq\\subseteq D^2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\preceq y\">\\(x\\preceq y\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\preceq\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\preceq\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in D\">\\(b\\in D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq D\">\\(S\\subseteq D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 是集合。下式引入偏序、有向性、上确界和带底有向完备性谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PO}\">\\(\\operatorname{PO}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Directed}\">\\(\\operatorname{Directed}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sup}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sup}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PCPO}\">\\(\\operatorname{PCPO}\\)</span>。这里的cpo约定包含最小元，不只是链完备性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PO}(D,\\preceq)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(\\forall x\\in D\\;x\\preceq x)\\land\n(\\forall x,y\\in D\\;(x\\preceq y\\land y\\preceq x\\Rightarrow x=y))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall x,y,z\\in D\\;(x\\preceq y\\land y\\preceq z\\Rightarrow x\\preceq z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Directed}(S;D,\\preceq)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ S\\subseteq D\\land S\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in S\\;\\exists z\\in S\\;(x\\preceq z\\land y\\preceq z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sup}(z,S;D,\\preceq)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ z\\in D\\land\n(\\forall x\\in S\\;x\\preceq z)\\land\n\\forall w\\in D\\;((\\forall x\\in S\\;x\\preceq w)\\Rightarrow z\\preceq w),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{PO}(D,\\preceq)\\land b\\in D\\land(\\forall x\\in D\\;b\\preceq x)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P(D)\\;(\\operatorname{Directed}(S;D,\\preceq)\\Rightarrow\\exists z\\in D\\;\\operatorname{Sup}(z,S;D,\\preceq)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PO}(D,\\preceq)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(\\forall x\\in D\\;x\\preceq x)\\land\n(\\forall x,y\\in D\\;(x\\preceq y\\land y\\preceq x\\Rightarrow x=y))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall x,y,z\\in D\\;(x\\preceq y\\land y\\preceq z\\Rightarrow x\\preceq z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Directed}(S;D,\\preceq)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ S\\subseteq D\\land S\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in S\\;\\exists z\\in S\\;(x\\preceq z\\land y\\preceq z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sup}(z,S;D,\\preceq)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ z\\in D\\land\n(\\forall x\\in S\\;x\\preceq z)\\land\n\\forall w\\in D\\;((\\forall x\\in S\\;x\\preceq w)\\Rightarrow z\\preceq w),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{PO}(D,\\preceq)\\land b\\in D\\land(\\forall x\\in D\\;b\\preceq x)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P(D)\\;(\\operatorname{Directed}(S;D,\\preceq)\\Rightarrow\\exists z\\in D\\;\\operatorname{Sup}(z,S;D,\\preceq)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书cpo约定的显式展开，供类型系统空间和不动点定理共用。偏序反对称性保证上确界唯一。原书此处使用“complete partial order”但只要求非空有向族的上确界和底，不要求任意子集都有上确界；因此不能直接把它当成完全格应用Knaster–Tarski定理。当前目录已有程序envelope中的完全格论证，没有这一一般cpo接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq\\subseteq D^2","display":false},{"tex":"x\\preceq y","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\preceq","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq D","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PO}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Directed}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sup}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PCPO}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PO}(D,\\preceq)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(\\forall x\\in D\\;x\\preceq x)\\land\n(\\forall x,y\\in D\\;(x\\preceq y\\land y\\preceq x\\Rightarrow x=y))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall x,y,z\\in D\\;(x\\preceq y\\land y\\preceq z\\Rightarrow x\\preceq z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Directed}(S;D,\\preceq)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ S\\subseteq D\\land S\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in S\\;\\exists z\\in S\\;(x\\preceq z\\land y\\preceq z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sup}(z,S;D,\\preceq)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ z\\in D\\land\n(\\forall x\\in S\\;x\\preceq z)\\land\n\\forall w\\in D\\;((\\forall x\\in S\\;x\\preceq w)\\Rightarrow z\\preceq w),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{PO}(D,\\preceq)\\land b\\in D\\land(\\forall x\\in D\\;b\\preceq x)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P(D)\\;(\\operatorname{Directed}(S;D,\\preceq)\\Rightarrow\\exists z\\in D\\;\\operatorname{Sup}(z,S;D,\\preceq)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2559,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-322","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order|df-pointed-directed-complete-order — Pointed directed complete orders]]"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-322","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order|df-pointed-directed-complete-order — Pointed directed complete orders]]"},{"id":"6630d30a282ae4b0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-per-type-system-extension]] 的 $\\mathfrak e$、$\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)$、$\\sqsubseteq_{\\mathfrak e}$、$\\bot_{\\mathfrak e}$、$J_{\\mathfrak e}$ 及 $\\operatorname{Dir}_{\\mathfrak e}$；固定 [[72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order]] 的 $\\operatorname{PCPO}$ 与 $\\operatorname{Sup}$。$D\\subseteq\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)$。"},{"id":"f02662d03d2c1226","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在ZFC元理论中，$D$ 是集合，$\\preceq\\subseteq D^2$，$b\\in D$，且 $\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)$，见 [[72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order]]。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order]]"}],"outgoing":[]}